docs/configuration.ja.md:1121:| `{issue_body}` | PR 本文 | Issue 本文 |
docs/configuration.ja.md:1122:| `{report}` | PR 本文 | Workflow 実行レポート |
docs/configuration.ja.md:1129:| `--auto-pr` | 実行後に PR を作成 |
docs/configuration.ja.md:1130:| `--draft` | 自動作成する PR を draft として作成（`--auto-pr` または `auto_pr` 設定が必要） |
docs/configuration.ja.md:1132:| `--repo <owner/repo>` | PR 作成用のリポジトリを指定 |
docs/ci-cd.md:5:TAKT can be integrated into CI/CD pipelines to automate task execution, PR reviews, and code generation. This guide covers GitHub Actions setup, pipeline mode options, and configuration for other CI systems.
docs/ci-cd.md:56:In pipeline mode, PRs are **not** created unless `--auto-pr` is explicitly specified. When `--auto-pr` is combined with `--skip-git`, no PR is created: TAKT prints a warning, and the run exits with the workflow result (code `0` only when the workflow itself succeeded).
docs/ci-cd.md:65:| `--pr <number>` | PR number to fetch review comments and fix |
docs/ci-cd.md:68:| `--auto-pr` | Create PR (interactive: skip confirmation, pipeline: enable PR) |
docs/ci-cd.md:69:| `--draft` | Create the PR as a draft (requires `--auto-pr` or `auto_pr` config) |
docs/ci-cd.md:71:| `--repo <owner/repo>` | Specify repository (for PR creation) |
