docs/ci-cd.md:154:| `{issue}` | Commit message, PR body | Issue number |
docs/ci-cd.md:155:| `{issue_body}` | PR body | Issue body |
docs/ci-cd.md:156:| `{report}` | PR body | Fixed string: ``Workflow `{workflow}` completed successfully.`` |
